# HomeVerse Backend

FastAPI backend service for AI Interior Design & Budget Planning Platform.

## Quick Start
```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate # On Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -e .[dev]
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8080
```
